    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="8" corresp="#wit-h">Cyninges mundbyrd: L scillinga.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" n="14" corresp="#wit-h">Cyninges mundbyrd, L scillinga.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver" corresp="#wit-h">[For violation of] the king’s protection, 50 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">The king’s <hi rend="italic">mundbyrd</hi> shall be 50 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock" corresp="#wit-h">The [breach of the] king’s protection, 50 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Königs Schutzgewalt [gilt] 50 Schillinge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">The king’s protective authority [is worth] 50 shillings.</ab>
        <note type="translator" source="#whitelock">Offences against anyone or any place under the king’s protection, but also including various acts showing lack of respect. Other persons than the king had their mund(byrd) “(right of giving) protection”.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
